# Android's /data on the TouchPad is a directory on the webOS media partition, which is FAT. installd
# cannot chown its directories there ("Failed to setup misc for user 0") and exits, and init restarted
# it every few seconds. Nothing in Halium installs packages, so leave it stopped once it has failed.
on property:init.svc.installd=restarting
    stop installd
